mode: "100644"
text: "# audience.md\n\nSave the filled copy to `~/.claude/virality/audience.md`. Ten minutes here decides whether the\nrewrite lands for YOUR viewers or for everyone, which means no one.\n\n## Niche\n\n- **In one line:** (e.g. \"budget meal prep for parents\", not \"food\")\n- **Platforms:** Reels / TikTok / Shorts / LinkedIn / YouTube\n- **Account size today:** ___ followers, typical post ___ views (your own median)\n\n## The one viewer\n\nDescribe one person, not a demographic: \"a parent of two spending $250 a week on groceries who\nwants it under $150 and has 20 minutes on Sunday\", not \"families\".\n\n- **Who they are:**\n- **What they want (in money, time or status):**\n- **What they have already tried:**\n- **The words THEY use for the problem** (copy from comments, DMs, search bars):\n\n## Offer\n\n- **What you sell or give away:**\n- **The comment keyword and what they get for it:** (e.g. comment PLAN, get the 7-day plan PDF)\n\n## Where to look (for step 2: find what's working)\n\n6 to 12 creators. Mostly within about 10x of your size, because a format that works at 2M\nfollowers often works because it is at 2M followers.\n\n- **4 direct** (same niche, slightly ahead):\n- **4 adjacent** (different niche, same viewer):\n- **2 to 4 big** (format only, never cadence or tone):\n"
